(6561199, 976258, 129807, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot of flame - I find it really hard to take pictures of fire without it blowing out, so hats off to you on that score. I see the demon in a couple of different places, depending on where my focus is at the time. And that, to me, is the problem. Flame is such an animated object, it feels like you took lots of shots in the hope of finding an example of pareidolia in one of them, rather than go and look for a naturally occurring example.</td>', 'This is a good shot of flame - I find it really hard to take pictures of fire without it blowing out, so hats off to you on that score. I see the demon in a couple of different places, depending on where my focus is at the time. And that, to me, is the problem. Flame is such an animated object, it feels like you took lots of shots in the hope of finding an example of pareidolia in one of them, rather than go and look for a naturally occurring example.', '2011-10-05 10:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
