(6562412, 977447, 70896, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a bit of a long shot for the challenge... Interesting shot, that one in the front is really distracting. A little bland IMO.</td>', 'I think it''s a bit of a long shot for the challenge... Interesting shot, that one in the front is really distracting. A little bland IMO.', '2011-10-06 15:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
