(6562424, 976340, 70896, '<td valign="top">I can see the face, but the photo is so small!! Too bad, looks like a great find. Wish I could see a lot more detail.</td>', 'I can see the face, but the photo is so small!! Too bad, looks like a great find. Wish I could see a lot more detail.', '2011-10-06 16:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
