(6562427, 977616, 70896, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice picture, but I think your pushing it a bit for this challenge. Could be sharper IMO.</td>', 'It''s a nice picture, but I think your pushing it a bit for this challenge. Could be sharper IMO.', '2011-10-06 16:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6562442, 977558, 70896, '<td valign="top">I can kinda see what you saw, but I think it might be pushing it a bit for the challenge. As for the actual pic, I really like the texture on the shell. I like the soft lighting, but the light spot is distracting, as are the other elements in the photo. If I were you I would get a little closer. :)</td>', 'I can kinda see what you saw, but I think it might be pushing it a bit for the challenge. As for the actual pic, I really like the texture on the shell. I like the soft lighting, but the light spot is distracting, as are the other elements in the photo. If I were you I would get a little closer. :)', '2011-10-06 16:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6562460, 977483, 108991, '<td valign="top">Oh dear, I saw a fish... I still like it!</td>', 'Oh dear, I saw a fish... I still like it!', '2011-10-06 16:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
