(6562540, 977529, 70896, '<td valign="top">Love this! The texture, the color... I love how dark and how subtle it is! One of my faves!</td>', 'Love this! The texture, the color... I love how dark and how subtle it is! One of my faves!', '2011-10-06 20:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
