(6563175, 977227, 36199, '<td valign="top"><u></u></td>', '', '2011-10-07 09:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6563338, 977533, 108069, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Reminds me a bit of Terrance and Phillip. Great light play and well done on the framing and alignment. Very cool.</td>', 'Excellent. Reminds me a bit of Terrance and Phillip. Great light play and well done on the framing and alignment. Very cool.', '2011-10-07 13:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6563363, 977494, 138630, '<td valign="top">The face is okay but not well enough defined for me and I find the blurred leafy overhang in the upper right very distracting.  You may well have found the mouth branch inserted this way, but it looks a bit as if you placed it there.  Bark texture is very nice.</td>', 'The face is okay but not well enough defined for me and I find the blurred leafy overhang in the upper right very distracting.  You may well have found the mouth branch inserted this way, but it looks a bit as if you placed it there.  Bark texture is very nice.', '2011-10-07 14:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6563365, 977456, 138630, '<td valign="top">These amorphous forms are interesting but I am not really reminded of phantoms.  Interesting jigsaw-like bark, though.</td>', 'These amorphous forms are interesting but I am not really reminded of phantoms.  Interesting jigsaw-like bark, though.', '2011-10-07 14:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6563368, 977600, 138630, '<td valign="top">There were so many light socket and similar images in this challenge (same could be said for knotholes etc.) that I found myself comparing to others in this "subset".  I did not find the angle or composition compelling and the faces were hard to "see" and secondary to the overall image.</td>', 'There were so many light socket and similar images in this challenge (same could be said for knotholes etc.) that I found myself comparing to others in this "subset".  I did not find the angle or composition compelling and the faces were hard to "see" and secondary to the overall image.', '2011-10-07 14:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6563371, 977341, 138630, '<td valign="top">Don''t know how to rate this -- I do see what appears to be two horseback riders coming toward the girl.  Are they really that or just a play of light?  It does matter, I think, for the challenge but either way they are not dominant enough in the image for a higher score from me.</td>', 'Don''t know how to rate this -- I do see what appears to be two horseback riders coming toward the girl.  Are they really that or just a play of light?  It does matter, I think, for the challenge but either way they are not dominant enough in the image for a higher score from me.', '2011-10-07 14:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6563372, 977498, 138630, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking this church had a rocket like look to you?  Not bad.  I''m afraid I don''t get the crop -- don''t watch enough TV, I guess.  A different take on the theme and that gets it a few points.</td>', 'I''m thinking this church had a rocket like look to you?  Not bad.  I''m afraid I don''t get the crop -- don''t watch enough TV, I guess.  A different take on the theme and that gets it a few points.', '2011-10-07 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6563417, 977362, 138630, '<td valign="top">Pretty scene but I am not able to make out a hand or any other recognizable shape in the sky which for me is essential to a high score in this challenge.</td>', 'Pretty scene but I am not able to make out a hand or any other recognizable shape in the sky which for me is essential to a high score in this challenge.', '2011-10-07 15:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6563418, 976962, 138630, '<td valign="top">The gnome is not apparent to me and I find the wires very distracting.  I guess with basic editing you can''t clone them out but maybe a different perspective or lighting would have eliminated or minimized them.</td>', 'The gnome is not apparent to me and I find the wires very distracting.  I guess with basic editing you can''t clone them out but maybe a different perspective or lighting would have eliminated or minimized them.', '2011-10-07 15:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6563421, 976749, 138630, '<td valign="top">I don''t see many that I "wuv" in this challenge but I do like this one a lot.  Though there are many faces, this one is different and I find the use of the brake lights, the knob on the dash, the insets in the seat backs and the roll bars (I hope I am naming all this correctly enough that you can understand me) very clever.  I love that these eyes have eyebrows and pupils and the mouth has teeth.  It gets the highest score I am giving.</td>', 'I don''t see many that I "wuv" in this challenge but I do like this one a lot.  Though there are many faces, this one is different and I find the use of the brake lights, the knob on the dash, the insets in the seat backs and the roll bars (I hope I am naming all this correctly enough that you can understand me) very clever.  I love that these eyes have eyebrows and pupils and the mouth has teeth.  It gets the highest score I am giving.', '2011-10-07 15:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6563422, 977559, 138630, '<td valign="top">The title, colors, depth of field and frame combine to give this a finished feeling that most of the other entries (mine included!) lack.  This is getting the highest score I am giving in this lackluster challenge.</td>', 'The title, colors, depth of field and frame combine to give this a finished feeling that most of the other entries (mine included!) lack.  This is getting the highest score I am giving in this lackluster challenge.', '2011-10-07 15:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6563457, 977494, 42181, '<td valign="top">I think i would have tried to remove the low hanging branch in the front of the frame, however i can totally see "the wink"</td>', 'I think i would have tried to remove the low hanging branch in the front of the frame, however i can totally see "the wink"', '2011-10-07 16:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6563465, 977602, 42181, '<td valign="top">Great picture, really well done, simple yet very effective.</td>', 'Great picture, really well done, simple yet very effective.', '2011-10-07 16:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6563479, 977498, 42181, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and totally get the rocket but i''m not so sure about the border.</td>', 'Nice shot and totally get the rocket but i''m not so sure about the border.', '2011-10-07 16:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6563484, 977477, 42181, '<td valign="top">Ohhh i remember when i had a flat top :-)</td>', 'Ohhh i remember when i had a flat top :-)', '2011-10-07 16:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6563509, 977135, 138630, '<td valign="top">I really like the tones and detail here -- "professor" in the title makes this for me.  I can just see this near-sighted, absent-minded professor peering at these rotting leaves.</td>', 'I really like the tones and detail here -- "professor" in the title makes this for me.  I can just see this near-sighted, absent-minded professor peering at these rotting leaves.', '2011-10-07 17:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6563512, 976945, 138630, '<td valign="top">This is one I didn''t get until I came back randomly to the thumbnail and the profile jumped out at me.  Nicely placed bird :) -- goatee needs to be trimmed a bit LOL</td>', 'This is one I didn''t get until I came back randomly to the thumbnail and the profile jumped out at me.  Nicely placed bird :) -- goatee needs to be trimmed a bit LOL', '2011-10-07 17:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6563520, 976636, 138630, '<td valign="top">Went through the entries too fast to appreciate this the first time around -- glad I came back.  Very well seen.  I see the head, eyes, beak and wings of the phoenix very clearly behind the Batman outline -- the natural depth of field really does make it look as if they are on different planes and facing off.  Giving this a good score for now and may well be back to bump it.</td>', 'Went through the entries too fast to appreciate this the first time around -- glad I came back.  Very well seen.  I see the head, eyes, beak and wings of the phoenix very clearly behind the Batman outline -- the natural depth of field really does make it look as if they are on different planes and facing off.  Giving this a good score for now and may well be back to bump it.', '2011-10-07 17:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
